# Handoff

The repo is the source of truth, not chat history.

1. Read `docs/STATUS.md` first. It says where we are, what is waiting on a human, and what to do next.
2. Read `AGENTS.md` next. Follow its read order and lane rules.
3. Do not start the next checkpoint while STATUS says we are waiting on human review.
4. Stay in your lane (ARCHITECTURE.md section 2). Do not silently edit `lib/types.ts`.
5. Before you stop, update `docs/STATUS.md` and your section of `docs/NOTES.md`, then commit with the slice.
